{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChMkdcEDMPfQ65XytxDto","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The `prwatch` loop is in and wired into `ard serve`, and `make test` passes. `go vet ./...` is clean. `gofmt -l .` flags only `internal/roles/testdata/docs/skips/src/_x.go`, which I didn't touch.\n\nThe loop runs every `intervals.prwatch` (default 5m), is skipped while paused, and takes no slot. It watches ard's PRs and:\n- **Closed without merging:** labels the issue `ard:needs-human` and posts one retry comment, unless the issue is closed, a merge is recorded, or another PR is open for it.\n- **Pending checks:** posts one status-issue notice per PR and head after `pr_watch.pending_timeout` (default 2h).\n- **Human merge:** records a `merge` event with the human as actor. ard's own merges are not recorded again.\n- **Red draft PR:** posts one comment per head naming the failed required checks.\n\nThe merger now calls `prgate.EvalChecks` instead of its own copy, and its check tests moved to `internal/prgate` unchanged. I added a regression test for #256 there: required contexts reported only as green commit statuses are never pending.\n\nConfig, the `pr_watch` table (migration 0008) and `ard config check` output are all done, along with the new \"PR watch loop\" section in `docs/proposal.md` and the entries in `docs/layout.md`. Per your comment I left CLAUDE.md alone.\n\n- **Only PRs seen open are acted on.** A PR closed or merged before the loop first saw it open is ignored, so installing it doesn't replay history. A PR opened and merged between two ticks is missed too.\n- **Marker comments differ slightly from the issue.** They include `pr=<n>`, because every PR's pending-checks notice goes to the one shared status issue.\n- **Human merge events have no `merge_sha`.** I added `MergedBy` to `PullRequest`; it is filled by `GetPR` only, since GitHub leaves it out of PR lists.\n\nMy report is at `.ard/267/worker-engineer.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1092,"cache_read_input_tokens":139752,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1092},"output_tokens":684,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38b45f0e-1977-46fe-92b9-68df068f9fb5","uuid":"2258c270-7be4-4a57-ab0b-fcead561804e","timestamp":"2026-11-24T12:28:30.684Z","request_id":"req_011ChMkdc3YuMvAEEF76vFzJ"}
